{
  "source_chain": "TheBetweenlands.preInit -> REGISTRIES.preInit -> ItemRegistry.preInit -> reflected BONE_HELMET/CHESTPLATE/LEGGINGS/BOOTS fields -> ItemBoneArmor(HEAD/CHEST/LEGS/FEET) -> ItemBLArmor(ARMOR_BONE,3,slot,bone) -> ItemArmor",
  "registration": "registerItem lowercases field Locale.ENGLISH, setsRegistryName ModInfo.ID; registerItems event registers ITEMS; TheBetweenlands registers ItemRegistry event subscriber.",
  "inventory": "ItemRegistry.registerModels -> proxy.registerDefaultItemRenderer -> ClientProxy.getItemModelMap default meta0 registryName#inventory -> base model item/generated and layer0. Gem property from CircleGemHelper controls three override models, all16 resolved. ItemBoneArmor not ITintedItem; no bone custom icon color handler in this hierarchy.",
  "worn": "No getArmorModel override in ItemBoneArmor or ItemBLArmor; ForgeHooksClient getArmorModel returns provided default when item hook null. Legacy LayerBipedArmor ccb creates inner ModelBiped(.5) and outer(1); head+hat, chest body+arms, legs body+legs, feet legs.",
  "texture": "ItemBLArmor.getArmorTexture tests CircleGemHelper.getGem; LEGS -> bone_2, other slots bone_1. Per gem replaces both resource paths. type parameter ignored but does not itself force overlay.",
  "actual_pass": "Vanilla agv.c(ItemStack) returns16777215 for nonLEATHER ARMOR_BONE. No getColor or hasOverlay override in bone hierarchy. Forge2773 hasOverlay compares !=0x00FFFFFF or LEATHER; false -> one untinted base pass, optional separate glint. Do not carry Item3DArmorFFFFFFFF doublepass to Bone.",
  "UV": "brq inflated8vertices with integer sourceUV unchanged; mirror swapsX and bql reverses ordered quad; bql UV corner order u2v1,u1v1,u1v2,u2v2. Original64×32 texture size bpx constructor. Default source establishes geometry, not final patched runtime proof.",
